{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01SJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-quasi-affine}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7dd0eb46d57fd33b32210825b217fb82742d655dc943cfdd1ac0634fd28489a6", "source_text": "The base change of a quasi-affine morphism is quasi-affine.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3194d114c6c502c225c3e4bd26cb9c99418c399c4b4afc344ab5314e7972dea2", "unit_id": "tag:01SO:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01SJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}_S$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0004": "$X \\to \\underline{\\Spec}_S(\\mathcal{A})$", "MATH_0005": "$S$", "MATH_0006": "$g : S' \\to S$", "MATH_0007": "$f' : X_{S'} = S' \\times_S X \\to S'$", "MATH_0008": "$f$", "MATH_0009": "$X_{S'} \\to \\underline{\\Spec}_{S'}(g^*\\mathcal{A})$", "MATH_0010": "$X_{S'} \\to S'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-characterize-quasi-affine}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-quasi-compact-preserved-base-change}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-base-change-immersion}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-spec-properties}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-characterize-quasi-affine}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e7b5437f9bbfb427a6253faac86c4757b032e32c73bfeb9378e5acd5fcc9fd47", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f10fc111ec841a5b0d85af3786dc8c148fdd01541a341f703bbe462dbe2e57fa", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a quasi-affine morphism.\nBy Lemma <REF_0001> above\nwe can find a quasi-coherent sheaf\nof <MATH_0002>-algebras <MATH_0003> and a quasi-compact\nopen immersion <MATH_0004>\nover <MATH_0005>.\nLet <MATH_0006> be any morphism.\nDenote <MATH_0007> the base change of <MATH_0008>.\nSince the base change of a quasi-compact open immersion is\na quasi-compact open immersion we see that\n<MATH_0009>\nis a quasi-compact open immersion\n(we have used Schemes, Lemmas\n<REF_0002> and\n<REF_0003> and\nConstructions, Lemma <REF_0004>).\nBy Lemma <REF_0005> again\nwe conclude that <MATH_0010> is quasi-affine.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:161a8f61973146a7c967e28c4e3c10527d2bc2c5ff88ce9cfd321128e0c55b84", "unit_id": "tag:01SO:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01SJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-compact-immersion-quasi-affine}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9d0a7aedce4f5580b4d8aaf2926dba767c107f961b289da57cf7d478f3f5f82d", "source_text": "A quasi-compact immersion is quasi-affine.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4ae0bc9b058536a3dc7f5bec502873d432855c34d31d2e29344ec9aeda79acce", "unit_id": "tag:02JR:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01SJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$X \\to S$", "MATH_0005": "$X \\to Z \\to S$", "MATH_0006": "$Z$", "MATH_0007": "$S$", "MATH_0008": "$X \\subset Z$", "MATH_0009": "$S$", "MATH_0010": "$Z$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-quasi-compact-immersion}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-closed-immersion}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:bd92c5c7acbf500954d6753d3ddf56f7e8620a6e1e5191b63b138e76a2a226fc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:67a40e40d5ace72fff5052da47c8e54e4719ac7f0c724f45eb39169d22ae419a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a quasi-compact immersion. We have to show the\ninverse image of every affine open is quasi-affine. Hence,\nassuming <MATH_0002> is an affine scheme, we have to show\n<MATH_0003> is quasi-affine. By Lemma <REF_0001>\nthe morphism <MATH_0004> factors as <MATH_0005> where <MATH_0006> is a closed\nsubscheme of <MATH_0007> and <MATH_0008> is a quasi-compact open.\nSince <MATH_0009> is affine Lemma <REF_0002> implies\n<MATH_0010> is affine. Hence we win.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0b03245e57cfb1dc64840479d7cdb8df36e5b63842e356960b0b598876a73327", "unit_id": "tag:02JR:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01SJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$f : X \\to S$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-affine-quasi-affine}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:73990217283a5d7824780f01f506239fd105cf1c3a875dc90dbfd98815608c1a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:011c703257aa3456e90fdecfe43cc02b813363db8401b8b36803fa8ce7a58e7e", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be an affine scheme.\nA morphism <MATH_0003> is quasi-affine if and only if it is quasi-compact.\nIn particular any morphism from an affine scheme to a quasi-separated\nscheme is quasi-affine.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6e433ca575c6f9cca0ceab3314287ca9ac33a7a1cd0fa18c49d78cf9dfb7c569", "unit_id": "tag:01SP:statement"}
